    "body": "Ok, no worries. As mentioned, we already implemented Homeassistant in #578, but honestly you're better off by copying an existing integration in the current code base, since it has changed since that PR.\nAlso note that the existing widgets and integration require the integration to be able to fetch using \"entity IDs\". If the Smart Home, you're looking to integrate, doesn't have a similar system, it will be more complex.",
