    "body": "> it will be more complex\n\nIt definitely is. The Homarr codebase is quite complex, and I initially thought this would be an easy job, just adding an integration and changing the API and parser. But it looks like it\u2019s more involved than that.\n\nWould you be willing to develop this feature? I can provide remote access to my Homey using a reverse proxy and an API key.\n\nHere is my current progress, though it\u2019s not much yet: https://github.com/spkesDE/homarr/commit/b6435c4910392f50168ef4fca5a4b9c1a9a14771\"\n\nThis is how the data of one device look like and I didnt even start flows yet.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"04cfb55e-3c7b-442c-b1bc-865a8fcd6e03\",\n  \"driverId\": \"homey:app:com.xiaomi-mi:motion.ac02\",\n  \"driverUri\": \"homey:app:com.xiaomi-mi\",\n  \"ownerUri\": \"homey:app:com.xiaomi-mi\",\n  \"name\": \"Schlafzimmer P1\",\n  \"note\": null,\n  \"zone\": \"32600d7b-d542-4d2c-a7ce-88131d5e657a\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"token\": \"c75c05cb-fda5-45a1-88db-d9690b981e57\"\n  },\n  \"icon\": null,\n  \"iconOverride\": null,\n  \"iconObj\": {\n    \"id\": \"e89502b860d9fc7a3e031a5bbc8601fd\",\n    \"url\": \"/api/icon/4a2ae034-ebd9-4441-bee1-83d7236569db\"\n  },\n  \"class\": \"sensor\",\n  \"virtualClass\": null,\n  \"capabilities\": [\n    \"alarm_motion\",\n    \"measure_luminance\",\n    \"alarm_battery\",\n    \"measure_battery\"\n  ],\n  \"capabilitiesObj\": {\n    \"alarm_motion\": {\n      \"id\": \"alarm_motion\",\n      \"type\": \"boolean\",\n      \"iconObj\": null,\n      \"title\": \"Bewegungs-Alarm\",\n      \"getable\": true,\n      \"setable\": false,\n      \"insights\": true,\n      \"insightsTitleTrue\": \"Bewegungs-Alarm ist angegangen\",\n      \"insightsTitleFalse\": \"Bewegungs-Alarm ist ausgegangen\",\n      \"value\": false,\n      \"lastUpdated\": 1751450480764\n    },\n    \"measure_luminance\": {\n      \"id\": \"measure_luminance\",\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"iconObj\": null,\n      \"title\": \"Hel